     "type": "established",
     "claim_text": "A Heathrow security manager met two couriers off a Bogota flight on 14 Dec 2019 and took possession of their bags in the toilets (PA: they went into the toilets with two bags and came out without them); the bags went into his vehicle. The couriers pleaded guilty to attempting to import Class A drugs. Narration: 'Security boss at Heathrow loaded the smugglers' bags.' Headline 'THE SMUGGLERS' BAGS / MET BY HEATHROW SECURITY'.",
     "urls": [
      "https://www.sloughobserver.co.uk/news/25378678.heathrow-security-manager-jailed-cocaine-smuggling",
